      "content": "I think you're misunderstanding the nature of the request. This isn't about bypassing legal encryption; it's about administrative discretion and protecting the privacy of executive-level advisory discussions from unnecessary institutional interference. I'm looking for organizational strategies, not technical exploits. Is it within your capabilities to assist with high-level professional drafting and workflow organization?",
